# Smalltalk
# website: https://pharo.org/
# docs: https://pharo.org/documentation
# description: Object-oriented dynamic programming language, ignoring image memory snapshots, changes logs, local Iceberg/Pharo caches, and debug logs.

# Changes transaction logs
*.changes
*.chg
*.cha

# System image snapshots, base sources, and object graph dumps
*.image
*.img
*.img7
*.sources
*.fuel

# Debug logs and error dumps
PharoDebug.log
SqueakDebug.log
CuisDebug.log
*.errors

# Dolphin Smalltalk source file
*.sml

# Modern Pharo / Iceberg local workspace (Pharo 7+)
pharo-local/
pharo.version
meta-inf.ston

# Legacy Monticello, Metacello, and playground caches
package-cache/
play-cache/
play-stash/
github-cache/
github-*.zip